{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1213217-soundtracks-of-beasts","id":1213217,"title":"Soundtracks of Beasts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-29T16:28:53-07:00","id":1213217,"title":"Soundtracks of Beasts","content":"I start a new topic, as I see I need to get some musical themes to run a game I may run in couple of months. And this thread will be different from <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/548046-songs-of-the-beast\">Songs of Beast</a> as I look for something different than those. Bear with me.<br /> <br /> <b>I look for the OST-like music to run with the Beast game sessions.</b> I generally use Official Soundtracks from movie and video games in my chronicles as main music themes as those tunes are much less distracting the players from the game than normal, songs-centric approach. So I ask nicely for your points what can nicely play in the background, not distracting a much of players for <b>Beast</b>? For now, I think about this albums...<br /> <br /> 1. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JbpD7Zn8EPU\" target=\"_blank\"><b>God of War</b> ( 2018 )</a> - Norse-centric video game about redemption and slaying gods. If we change gods for monsters - we got a Hero-like view point for the <b>BtP</b> game.<br /> <br /> 2. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SMIhHr4TrY8&amp;index=2&amp;list=PL0234CCEFE4886828\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Beowulf</b> ( 2007 )</a> - Anglosaxon legend about Norse prince coming to land to kill a iconic monster.<br /> <br /> Maybe something much more modern for the games?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdh